 or new loss of taste or smell.**\n**Am following all CDC recommended guide
 lines\, above\, and limiting my exposure to the novel coronavirus/COVID-19
 .**\n\\# Arrival\\\, Weather\\\, & Cancellations\nPlease come to the start
 ing point 10 minutes ahead of time so the hike can start promptly. Times a
 re our best estimates\; they can vary depending on conditions\, and the si
