 peratures above 90 degrees and steady rain cancels\, but intermittent driz
 zle does not. You will *not* be notified.** **Bring water. Wear hiking boo
 ts\, preferably waterproof with good soles and traction devices and bring 
 poles (optional).** Dogs are not allowed on hikes unless specified.\nThese
